config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Codex host
    participant S as Existing review preparation
    participant J as NEW JEV adapter
    participant P as NEW local policy engine
    participant T as TypeSafe API
    participant G as Existing Guardian
    participant E as Existing enforcement
    C->>S: Capture one immutable action and authorization revision
    S->>J: Review attempt with cancellation and deadline
    alt Eligible, complete, consented snapshot
        J->>P: Exact action, effective policy and provenance-bearing evidence
        P->>T: One request: state + independent typed questions
        T-->>P: Choice distributions/confidence and Noul values
        P->>P: Validate, apply deterministic thresholds and write audit
        P-->>J: Bound candidate and effective decision
        J->>J: Recheck policy and local/root authorization
    else Mandatory / fresh / retry / escalation / unsupported
        J-->>S: No JEV decision
    end
    alt JEV abstains, shadow mode, fails, or becomes stale
        S->>G: Original synchronous review
        G-->>S: Original structured assessment
    else Valid eligible JEV result
        J-->>S: GuardianAssessment through existing host path
    end
    S->>S: Original stale-authorization and cancellation check
    S-->>C: Existing reporting and final review result
    C->>E: Enforce permissions before any execution
    Note over C,E: A classifier output is not a sandbox bypass or proof of execution.
